1
00:00:09,442 --> 00:00:15,929
One job on this board has nobody against
it. Until it does, it is a note rather than

2
00:00:15,929 --> 00:00:16,315
work.

3
00:00:16,779 --> 00:00:21,423
Open it, and the place where a name
goes is the first thing on the right.

4
00:00:21,873 --> 00:00:30,096
The list is the people who work in this
workspace. Not the whole company — the ones

5
00:00:30,096 --> 00:00:32,276
who could actually go.

6
00:00:32,726 --> 00:00:39,132
Choose one, and it is theirs. It lands on
their phone and joins their day, without

7
00:00:39,132 --> 00:00:41,085
anybody being told twice.

8
00:00:41,537 --> 00:00:47,925
The trail keeps it: who decided, and
when. Nobody has to remember who sent whom

9
00:00:47,925 --> 00:00:48,410
where.

10
00:00:48,861 --> 00:00:54,202
And on their own page it is simply there,
among everything else they are carrying.

11
00:00:55,998 --> 00:01:01,246
Next: the same job followed all the way
through, to the report the client signs.

